# error: 26:12: `unwrap` returns a view of `o`, but its signature says it views only `d`
# error: 34:3: `mk` returns a view of `x`, but its signature says it views only `c`
# error: 41:3: `payload` returns a view of `o`, but its signature says it views only `d`
